# Consecration of the Chrism

[Rubric] *The Bishop may then consecrate oil of Chrism, placing a hand on the vessel of oil, and saying*
[Bishop] Eternal Father, whose blessed Son was anointed by the Holy Spirit to be the Savior and servant of all, we pray you to consecrate this oil, that those who are sealed with it may share in the royal priesthood of Jesus Christ; who lives and reigns with you and the Holy Spirit, for ever and ever.
[People] **Amen.**
